It's my favorite kind of shark, 
and this is my second favorite.

1147
00:13:24,030 --> 00:13:25,620
Oh, really?

1148
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:28,080
But my real favorite is the sawshark!

1149
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:30,410
I see. So, that's your real favorite, huh?

1150
00:13:30,410 --> 00:13:33,460
Mitsuru, there's another shark over here!

1151
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:34,670
What?!

1152
00:13:34,670 --> 00:13:36,130
Where?!

1153
00:13:36,130 --> 00:13:36,880
Look!

1154
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,170
Whoa, you're right!

1155
00:13:38,170 --> 00:13:44,180
The reason sharks don't eat the other fishes 
in the water tank is 'cause they're given plenty of food.

1156
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:47,970
So, they're just like you when it comes 
to calming down on a full belly, Mitsuru.

1157
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:50,930
Next time, let's get some good meat buns, okay?

1158
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:50,350
