Geez, just for a little while. You've gotten heavy lately.

1177
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,660
Can you see now?

1178
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:12,960
Yeah. There's another Japanese bullhead shark!

1179
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:15,420
Oh! Soma-kun, what is it?

1180
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:17,420
It's nothing.

1181
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:23,220
What is he doing?

1182
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:27,350
Hey, Morikawa-san, aren't you 
going to take some pictures?

1183
00:14:27,350 --> 00:14:28,680
I'll take one with the Japanese bullhead shark!

1184
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:47,370
What is she doing?

1185
00:14:48,530 --> 00:14:53,040
The dolphin-sea lion show 
in the outdoor stadium will be starting shortly.

1186
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:56,420
Please come to the show with your friends and family.

1187
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:58,040
I gotta go!

1188
00:14:59,550 --> 00:15:01,130
Hey, don't run!

1189
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:03,340
Besides, you forgot your bag!

1190
00:15:08,350 --> 00:15:10,060
What did I tell you?

1191
00:15:11,230 --> 00:15:14,430
You promised me you wouldn't cry today.

1192
00:15:15,890 --> 00:15:17,150
Are you okay?

1193
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:19,820
It hurts. I can't walk.

1194
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:22,730
Ouchies begone! Stand up.

1195
00:15:22,730 --> 00:15:24,360
Nee-chan, piggyback!

1196
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:26,320
Piggyback!

1197
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,280
Geez...

1198
00:15:30,580 --> 00:15:34,040
Don't cry. The show's gonna start without us.

1199
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:34,750
Upsy-daisy!

1200
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:45,840
It's so high! I'm scared!

1201
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,920
Wh-whoa!

1202
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,010
Oh, sorry!

1203
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:53,770
No, pick me up again!

1204
00:15:53,770 --> 00:15:55,520
Make up your mind.

1205
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,560
Sorry, Soma-kun.

1206
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,520
Thank you.

1207
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,330
It's nothing.

1208
00:16:07,780 --> 00:16:10,120
Morikawa, do you just have two brothers?

1209
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:13,490
I have a sister in middle school, too. How about you?

1210
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:17,540
I'm an only child. I can't 
imagine being one of four siblings.

1211
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:24,800
What's wrong?

1212
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:26,090
Oh, no!

1213
00:16:26,090 --> 00:16:27,720
Uh, what is it?

1214
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,300
Don't move!

1215
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:34,350
Just come this way.

1216
00:16:34,890 --> 00:16:36,890
I don't really get it.

1217
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:39,600
Don't hit your head!

1218
00:16:40,850 --> 00:16:42,900
Natsume, you have an older sister, right?

